plt.plot(t, Vendite, color="black")
plt.plot(t, M, "o-", color="black", markerfacecolor="none", markersize=4)
plt.title("Vendite GM e smussamento esponenziale (alfa=0.25)", fontsize=10)
plt.show()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![Figura 4.4 – Vendite G.M. e smussamento esponenziale della serie](04-serie-storiche_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-12-1.png)
:::
